{title: I’ve been delivered}
{x_theme: healing, salvation}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/I_ve been delivered.docx}

{comment: Chorus}
I’ve been delivered, I’ve been delivered
That hold the devil had on me, He ain’t got no more
I’ve been delivered, I’ve been delivered
I’ve been delivered by the hand of the Lord

{comment: Verse 1}
Jesus healed the blind man and made him see
Cast demons out of a man from the Gadareens
He cleansed the leper to, made the lame brand new
Put hope back in a hopeless life I testify to you

{comment: Verse 2}
He saved a man I know so close to death
He gave the boy with asthma back his breath
The best miracle to see is when Jesus sets you free
You know when He sets you free you know you’re free in deed
